(operation-gauntlet)
*title Full-table operation gauntlet
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *define gauntlet
    gauntlet = table(operation-gauntlet);
  *file operations.dat time gauntlet
  *segment 1 evaluate
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.1
    *when time=1 stop
*end
